{"version":1,"content":"<p>有「音樂教父」之稱的台灣歌手羅大佑，當年與蔣志光合唱《皇后大道東》唱到街知巷聞，現年72歲的他寶刀未老，攜手交響樂團巡迴演出，8月唱完台北站後，10登陸北京，11月前進武漢、深圳，雖然唱到《愛人同志》時，幽默自嘲「冇咗半條命」！</p><p>其實他心目中</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T20:20:32.507677+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T20:01:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T20:18:09.759467+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T20:18:09.759467+00:00","content_hash":"41c1592d290fac0fa3205e03278bfb7a5d748c0d81b7e0f53d810a64d398b530","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}